  selectedExpression: 1
  selectedTextKey: maid_leviathan_partner_intro
  selectedText: Lady Sherry is this close... My heart will not stop racing... Leviathan
    is so happy right now...
  giftExpression: 2
  giftTextKey: maid_leviathan_partner_gift
  giftText: I prepared this while thinking of you Lady Sherry... If you accept it
    Leviathan will be happy with that alone...
  maxSkillGiftExpression: 2
  maxSkillGiftTextKey: maid_leviathan_partner_extra_gift
  maxSkillGiftText: There is one more... Leviathan's feelings for Lady Sherry simply
    will not stop...
  farewellExpression: 3
  farewellTextKey: maid_leviathan_partner_finish
  farewellText: Today was the greatest gift Leviathan could ask for... Could we be
    together again next time...?
